<title>HUNGARY: Cofinec swings to losses in Jan-Sept 96.</title>
<headline>Cofinec swings to losses in Jan-Sept 96.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-Sept 1996    Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>Group operating result</p>
<p>	 before taxation	   14.8 loss   vs     23.6 profit</p>
<p>    Group net income	     19.2 loss   vs     13.0 profit</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     492.8	  vs    497.5</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales     389.8	  vs    365.2</p>
<p>    Operating expenses	   79.7	  vs     78.1</p>
<p>    Other net income		4.6 loss   vs	4.6 loss</p>
<p>    Net interest income	  26.0 loss   vs     26.1 loss</p>
<p>    Taxation			  1.7	  vs	0.7</p>
<p>    Minorities			2.7 loss   vs	9.9  loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Cofinec is a French-registered packaging company with operations in Central Europe. The figures are consolidated and are calculated according to International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
